WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.032
At a BitPOS table, ordering starts with a

00:00:03.072 --> 00:00:05.027
scan. Then just say what you'd like.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:09.963
AI Coffee Copilot listens, or reads what you

00:00:10.003 --> 00:00:12.580
type, and turns your words into a clear order:

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:14.628
the item, the options and the price.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.660
Nothing is ordered until you check it and tap

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:20.069
confirm.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.614
Checkout runs on x402, an open payment

00:00:25.654 --> 00:00:28.618
protocol that connects a service to payment

00:00:28.658 --> 00:00:30.084
over HTTP, on Solana.

00:00:30.124 --> 00:00:33.297
The cafe asks for USDC, your wallet signs, and

00:00:33.337 --> 00:00:36.371
the payment is verified before your order is

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:36.720
made.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.077
You decide how payments are approved:

00:00:41.117 --> 00:00:43.651
every time, or with a time-limited permission

00:00:43.691 --> 00:00:45.196
— daily, weekly or monthly.

00:00:45.236 --> 00:00:47.713
You set a limit per order, a total allowance

00:00:47.753 --> 00:00:50.173
and an expiry, and you can revoke it at any

00:00:50.213 --> 00:00:50.459
time.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:55.384
The limits are enforced by a delegated signer,

00:00:55.424 --> 00:00:58.277
not by the AI. x402 carries each payment; it

00:00:58.317 --> 00:01:00.381
never hands Copilot your wallet.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:02.880
Want the same again?

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:04.952
Copilot checks today's price and your

00:01:04.992 --> 00:01:06.072
remaining allowance.

00:01:06.112 --> 00:01:08.649
You still confirm, without a wallet pop-up for

00:01:08.689 --> 00:01:11.169
every order. And when the allowance runs out,

00:01:11.209 --> 00:01:12.401
it stops and asks you.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.836
AI Coffee Copilot with x402.

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.651
Easier ordering, fewer repeat choices, and

00:01:19.691 --> 00:01:21.059
spending you control.

00:01:21.099 --> 00:01:22.533
Coming soon to BitPOS.

